ons and conditions from Problem II.8.79 are not included.\n\nThe subsequent integration is correct. Independently, setting \\(u=\\sqrt{2t}\\) gives\n\\[\n\\int_0^y\\sqrt{\\frac2\\pi}\\,t^{-1/2}e^{-2t}\\,dt\n=\\frac2{\\sqrt\\pi}\\int_0^{\\sqrt{2y}}e^{-u^2}\\,du\n=\\operatorname{erf}(\\sqrt{2y}).\n\\]\nDifferentiating the proposed CDF recovers exactly that assumed density. Thus the verified **conditional** result is\n\\[\nF_{Y_2}(y)=\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&y\\le 0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{erf}(\\sqrt{2y}),&y>0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\]\n\nLikewise, the Lévy formula proves the submitted density for \\(Z_\\alpha\\) **only if**\n\\[\n\\mathbb E[e^{-\\lambda Z_\\alpha}]=e^{-\\alpha\\sqrt{2\\lambda}},\n\\]\nwhich must come from Problem II.8.79; the displayed formula alone does not identify \\(Z_\\alpha\\).\n\n**Conclusion:** There is no algebraic contradiction in the final integration. The unsupported transition is identifying the displayed density with that of \\(Y_2\\) (and identifying \\(a=\\alpha\\) for \\(Z_\\alpha\\)). Without the referenced definitions, the submitted answers cannot be verified as answers to the original problem."}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":2111,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":2108,"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":503,"output_tokens_details":{"reason